  "body": "**Status: research note / scoped negative result. No new \u03ba.**\n\nPartitions PR869's U8 paid profile by phase and register role and\nprices zero-parent-cost interface relaxations with the pinned engines and outer47. Finds that\nthe complex side has under two local mass units/call of headroom before PR589 binds\n(cap \u03ba = 0.001730427469823602, same for T37), and that PR589 COPY deletion alone cannot reach\n\u03ba > 0.01. Replay: `make t21-interface-budget-verify`. Credits PR869/870, PR890, PR942, PR881,\nPR935, PR589/555. Substantial AI assistance: Claude Opus 5.5.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [[Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WZjeXW5iZwkmNxMw6nWifS",
